unction: identity(x) = x\\n(identity: lambda (Natural x) x)\\n\\n# Apply identity function\\n(? (apply identity 0.7))\\n\\n# === Type Queries ===\\n# \\\"What is the type of zero?\\\"\\n(? (type of zero))\\n\\n# === Combining Types with Probabilistic Logic ===\\n# The type system coexists with the probabilistic logic\\n((zero = zero) has probability 1)\\n(? (zero = zero))\\n\\n# === Paradox Resolution ===\\n# The liar paradox works alongside types — resolves to 0.5\\n(s: s is s)\\n((s = false) has probability 0.5)\\n(? (s = false))\\n\\n# === Universe Hierarchy (Lean/Rocq compatibility) ===\\n# Both (Type: Type Type) and (Type N) coexist\\n(Type 0)\\n(Type 1)\\n(? ((Type 0) of (Type 1)))\",--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nword-bomb/words.txt at main · WordReaper/word-bomb · GitHub (https://github.com/WordReaper/word-bomb/blob/main/words.txt)\nciteturn7search9 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: yesterday; interpretation ... joke ... language ... lean\n\ninstall\n\ninstance\n\ninstant\n\ninstead\n\ninstitute\n\ninstitution\n\ninstruction\n\ninstrument\n\ninsurance\n\nintellectual\n\nintelligence\n\nintelligent\n\nintend\n\nintense\n\nintention\n\ninteraction\n\ninterest\n\ninterested\n\ninteresting\n\ninternal\n\ninternational\n\ninternet\n\ninterpret\n\ninterpretation\n\ninterval\n\nintervention\n\ninterview\n\ninto\n\nintroduce\n\nintroduction\n\ninvest\n\ninvestigate\n\ninvestigation\n\ninvestment\n\ninvite\n\ninvolve\n\ninvolved\n\ninvolvement\n\niron\n\nisland\n\nissue\n\nit\n\nitem\n\nits\n\nitself\n\njacket\n\njam\n\njob\n\njoin\n\njoint\n\njoke\n\njournalist\n\njourney\n\njoy\n\njudge\n\njudgment\n\njuice\n\njump\n\njumper\n\njunior\n\njury\n\njust\n\njustice\n\njustify\n\nkeen\n\nkeep\n\nkettle\n\nkey\n\nkeyboard\n\nkick\n\nkid\n\nkill\n\nkilometre\n\nkind\n\nking\n\n\nkiss\n\nkit\n\nkitchen\n\nknee\n\nknife\n\nknock\n\nknow\n\nknowledge\n\nknown\n\nlab\n\nlabel\n\nlaboratory\n\nlabour\n\nlack\n\nlad\n\nladder\n\nlady\